<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4496" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλο</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything else</i>, in interrog. sentences, mostly foll. by
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤ, ἤ σοι ἄλλο τι φαίνεται . . ἢ
				λόγος</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				258a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phd.</u>
				64c
			</span></i>:—hence freq. (esp. in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i>) elliptical, implying an affirm. answer, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλο τι ἢ πεινήσουσι</span>; (i.e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλο τι πείσονται ἢ πεινήσουσι</span>;)
				<i>will</i> they <i>not</i> be starved? <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.14
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				1.109
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλο τι ἢ ἠρέμα
				ἐπανασκεψόμεθα</span>; <i>shall we not</i> calmly
			reconsider? (i.e. let us do so) <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				154e
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phd.</u>
				70c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Men.</u>
				82d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Grg.</u>
				481c
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλο τι ἢ καταγελῴης
			ἄν</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				1.116d
			</span></i>:— with other words interposed, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκόπει εἰ ἄλλο τι λέγεις ἢ τόδε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					200d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phd.</u>
				106a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sph.</u>
				228a
			</span></i>, etc.:—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλοτιπλήν</span> . . ; <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				228a
			</span></i>:—but often <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλο
			τι</span> with or without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖν</span>
			stands alone, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλο τι οὖν . .
			ἔλεγες</span>; <i>did not</i> you say? <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				495c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				470b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phd.</u>
				79b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tht.</u>
				165e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				337c
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> rarely
			without a question, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόγνοια τοῦ ἄλλο τι ἢ κρατεῖν τῆς
					γῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.85
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
